{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>hitogata</strong> is a gnarly adventure game about dolls, electricity, and ending the world with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- STORY -\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something terrible happened six months ago. Nowadays, everyone is anticipating the next big terrible thing. This is where <strong>you</strong>\u00a0come in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your (new!) best friend devise a plan to put the world out of its misery. Doing so requires you to journey deep into the city and power it down section by section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper into the world, reality begins to wrap its arms around you. And if you play your cards right, your friends (maybe) won\u2019t eat you alive in the process\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- KEY FEATURES -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey deep into an expansive city!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become engrossed in an engaging yet twisted world AND story!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into dumb arguments with a cast of weirdos and losers!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve (MOSTLY) fun puzzles!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt your brain with the funky art direction inspired by weird things you\u2019d see on tv!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731410?t=1757704823","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731410?t=1757704823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731410/04f3964136a309233dab9111a018c1088ec9b9f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757704823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731410/04f3964136a309233dab9111a018c1088ec9b9f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757704823","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"hitogata contains extreme violence, mutilation, death, depictions of abuse and pretty much everything surrounding that... and worst of all... USE OF DRUGS!?!"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>hitogata</strong> is a gnarly adventure game about dolls, electricity, and ending the world with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- STORY -\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something terrible happened six months ago. Nowadays, everyone is anticipating the next big terrible thing. This is where <strong>you</strong>\u00a0come in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your (new!) best friend devise a plan to put the world out of its misery. Doing so requires you to journey deep into the city and power it down section by section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper into the world, reality begins to wrap its arms around you. And if you play your cards right, your friends (maybe) won\u2019t eat you alive in the process\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- KEY FEATURES -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey deep into an expansive city!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become engrossed in an engaging yet twisted world AND story!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into dumb arguments with a cast of weirdos and losers!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"